{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226220","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226220","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:4:1222622001:1":{"text":"With Bonnie caught, getting the info about the relic from her will be easy as pie.","source_cn":"波妮人抓到了，从她口中逼问出圣器的所在地轻而易举。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94284D889FB1BEB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222622002:0":{"text":"I'll return her to the Carmine Whispers tomorrow for a proper interrogation. For now, let's rest.","source_cn":"明天带她回血薇帮再好好审问。先休息吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x216A9CCB90DCA197","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1222622002":{"text":"I'll return her to the Carmine Whispers tomorrow for a proper interrogation. For now, let's rest.","source_cn":"明天带她回血薇帮好好审问。先休息吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x216A9CCB90DCA197","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222622003:1":{"text":"Oh, Magister, you must rest well! Let Chippy and I handle the watch!","source_cn":"是呀，不能让梅林守夜，还是让我们来。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1F1A1AFC1FF6A288","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Oh, Magister, you must rest well! Let Chippy and I handle the watch!","female":"Oh, Magister, you must rest well! Let Chippy and I handle the watch!","variant_male_record_index":"137525","variant_female_record_index":"137526","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222622005:1":{"text":"Chippy, why don't you take the first half of the night, and I'll handle the second half?","source_cn":"满满，你守前半夜，我负责后半夜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA95BEE6B63A80F42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222622006:1":{"text":"Actually, Chippy's full of energy! Chippy can do the whole night!","source_cn":"我精神百倍，守一整晚也没问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71E58DBBE210A7D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222622007:1":{"text":"Well, since you're so confident, I'll leave it to you. But you'd better make sure Bonnie doesn't escape!","source_cn":"既然你这么有自信，那就交给你啦，可千万不能让波妮逃走哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6FD4F146E1EDD12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222622008:1":{"text":"Of course! Nothing will go wrong with Sir Chippy here!","source_cn":"放心，绝对不会出事的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23B620AF7E4D76A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:16:1222622009:0":{"text":"Everyone deliberately talks loud enough so that Bonnie can hear you from nearby.","source_cn":"大家故意提高音量，让不远处的波妮听清了这些话","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47C5D84917395223","varian